## Brief Overview

---

Malaga Event Gear stocks one wireless uplighting kit, an ADJ Element H6 Pack of 6 battery powered fixtures, as a separate item from its standard event packages. It is real inventory, deployed with a technician for weddings and corporate MICE events across Malaga and the wider Costa del Sol, and it is not bundled into the [Eco Pack](/packages/eco/), [Basic MICE Pack](/packages/basic-mice/), [Wedding Pack](/packages/wedding/) or [MICE Pack](/packages/mice/). There is no published a la carte price, so [contact us](/contact/) with your venue and event details and we will confirm availability and a quote.

